  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FUGRO: Coastal Risk Index Platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Coastal Risk Index is an innovative online platform that assesses coastal flooding risks in the face of climate change. By modeling flood hazards and storm surges under current and future climate scenarios, CRI empowers financial institutions, insurers, investors, and policymakers with critical data. This tool highlights the benefits of resilient ecosystems, promoting Nature-based Solutions to reduce risk, enhance coastal resilience, and restore ecosystems,supporting informed decision-making to protect vulnerable communities and the natural environment.</narrative>
  </description>
